          "content": "<Warning>\n  This endpoint is not live yet. The shapes below show how it is expected to work so you can plan your\n  integration, and may change before release. Calls to this path return `404` today.\n</Warning>\n"
        },
        "description": "Delete an environment and tear down its infrastructure.\n\nThe environment moves through `archive_queued`, `archiving` and `archived`, or `archive_failed` on failure.",
        "parameters": [
